id=peridot-qca6750-injection-test
name=Peridot QCA6750 Monitor and Packet Injection
version=1.0
versionCode=10
author=CoderArceus
description=Stock-aligned monitor mode & packet injection driver for POCO F6 (peridot) QCA6750 with STA helper vdev injection, Loukious WMI mgmt tx, sysfs & iw/iwconfig channel control, and terminal CLI (pwm/wlan-mode). Compatible with KernelSU, SuKiSU, APatch, and Magisk.
